Moreover, the investments in PP&E are pivotal for 3M's operations, helping to meet product demand and enhance manufacturing efficiency. This emphasis on capital expenditures relative to cash flow and ongoing operations indicates the capital-intensive nature of 3M's business model (Source: 3M 2022 10-K Report).",,,"[""3M_2022_10K"", ""3M_2023Q2_10Q"", ""3M_2018_10K""]","Source: data\pdfs\3M_2018_10K.pdf

