From the available data, we're currently missing the exact FY2015 figures for AMD's financials. However, based on general calculations, the formula for calculating the D&A % margin is:

\[
\text{D&A \% Margin} = \left( \frac{\text{Depreciation and Amortization}}{\text{Net Revenue}} \right) \times 100
\]

If you can provide me with the specific D&A value and net revenue from the FY2015 P&L statement, I can help calculate the percentage margin. Otherwise, I don't have access to the exact numbers needed to perform this calculation.",,,"[""AMD_2022_10K""]","Source: data\pdfs\AMD_2022_10K.pdf

