insurance companies. The Company’s HMO and insurance subsidiaries report their financial statements in accordance with accounting practices prescribed by
state regulatory authorities which may differ from GAAP. The combined statutory net income for the years ended and estimated combined statutory and capital
surplus at December 31, 2022, 2021 and 2020 for the Company’s insurance and HMO subsidiaries were as follows:
